# NOTICE

This project automates the WorkBuddy "Buddy Station" daily check-in.
The API surface was reverse-engineered from the WorkBuddy desktop client and
is not officially documented — endpoints, headers and error codes may change
in any client update.

You are responsible for:
  - complying with the terms of service of the services you automate;
  - keeping your own credentials (AirScript-Token, refresh tokens) private —
    the repository ships empty templates, never commit real values;
  - setting appropriate permissions on any sheet that stores a token.
